<metadata><name>Day 63 - Slough of Despond</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.788789" lon="-80.996628"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Colpoy's Range Rd. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.782298" lon="-80.992947"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Slough of Despond Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed President's Path goes off on your right (NO DOGS on it).)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.775077" lon="-80.982673"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Slough of Despond Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed President's Path goes off on your right (NO DOGS on it).)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.761304" lon="-80.985633"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
